# research — axe-driven research with bobby review, axe writes memo
#
# Usage: loom p research run "what's happening with AVGO?" [--model opus]

do axe "$INTAKE"                                                      @research
do axe "what are the driving forward factors"                         @factors
do axe "do a forward analysis"                                        @forward
do axe "are there any threads you want to research — rabbit holes? do it"  @deep-dive

---

do bobby hears axe "attack this thesis. find gaps, check math, challenge assumptions."  @critique
do axe hears bobby                                                    @rebuttal

---

do axe "write the memo" use writer                                    @memo
